{"version":1,"content":"<p>今日（15日）凌晨2時許，警方接報一名年約40歲男子在西貢滘西洲對開約5米海面漂浮，懷疑遇溺，途經舢舨的船家將男事主救起，送往早禾坑碼頭。</p><p>男事主昏迷送往將軍澳醫院，惜搶救後證實不治。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T13:19:44.095907+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":92,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T02:23:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T14:17:49.255091+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T13:17:41.178027+00:00","content_hash":"bc56dea9420bb3e498dfc064dfb099880f1a7d4ae7ecbb419f36da4234600357","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}